post.description:
MCP (Model Context Protocol) 端点，用于处理MCP协议请求。
**协议说明**：
本端点遵循 JSON-RPC 2.0 规范，支持以下方法：
**1. initialize** - 初始化MCP连接
```json
{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": "init-1",
  "method": "initialize",
  "params": {
    "protocolVersion": "2024-11-05",
    "capabilities": {},
    "clientInfo": {
      "name": "MyClient",
      "version": "1.0.0"
    }
  }
}
```
**2. tools/list** - 列出所有可用工具
```json
{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": "list-1",
  "method": "tools/list",
  "params": {}
}
```
**3. tools/call** - 调用工具
```json
{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": "call-1",
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "nmap",
    "arguments": {
      "target": "192.168.1.1",
      "ports": "80,443"
    }
  }
}
```
**4. prompts/list** - 列出所有提示词模板
```json
{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": "prompts-list-1",
  "method": "prompts/list",
  "params": {}
}
```
**5. prompts/get** - 获取提示词模板
```json
{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": "prompt-get-1",
  "method": "prompts/get",
  "params": {
    "name": "prompt-name",
    "arguments": {}
  }
}
```
**6. resources/list** - 列出所有资源
```json
{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": "resources-list-1",
  "method": "resources/list",
  "params": {}
}
```
**7. resources/read** - 读取资源内容
```json
{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": "resource-read-1",
  "method": "resources/read",
  "params": {
    "uri": "resource://example"
  }
}
```
**错误代码说明**：
- `-32700`: Parse error - JSON解析错误
- `-32600`: Invalid Request - 无效请求
- `-32601`: Method not found - 方法不存在
- `-32602`: Invalid params - 参数无效
- `-32603`: Internal error - 内部错误
